# Generated by scripts/build-docs.mjs on every dev and build run: the published
# copy of docs/api/quickstart.md, its examples, the OpenAPI contract and the
# Postman collection. Committing it would put a second copy of the quickstart in
# the tree, and the two would disagree the first time somebody edited one.
